{
  "title": { "zh": "两边都是 1", "en": "Both are 1" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到这里为止，说什么只取决于一根线。这一次板同时听两根线，说出的位由两根线一起决定。",
        "en": "So far what the board says has depended on one wire. Now it listens to two, and what it says depends on both."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1-3",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "听两根线：两根线上都是 1 时说 1，否则说 0。",
        "en": "Listen to two wires: say 1 when both carry a 1, and 0 otherwise."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "先固定线 A 的值，看线 B 该怎样决定输出。",
          "en": "Hold wire A still and see how wire B should decide the output."
        },
        { "zh": "线 A 为 0 时，输出是什么？线 A 为 1 时呢？", "en": "When wire A is 0, what is the output? And when A is 1?" }
      ],
      "wires": {
        "in": [
          { "name": "a", "label": { "zh": "线 A", "en": "Wire A" } },
          { "name": "b", "label": { "zh": "线 B", "en": "Wire B" } }
        ],
        "out": [{ "name": "x", "label": { "zh": "出线", "en": "Wire out" } }]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "wires": { "a": { "send": [{ "bits": "0101" }] }, "b": { "send": [{ "bits": "0011" }] } },
          "expect": { "x": [0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0] }
        },
        {
          "wires": { "a": { "send": [{ "bits": "110100" }] }, "b": { "send": [{ "bits": "011101" }] } },
          "expect": { "x": [0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0] }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "wires": { "a": { "send": [{ "bits": "1111" }] }, "b": { "send": [{ "bits": "0000" }] } },
          "expect": { "x": [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] }
        },
        {
          "wires": { "a": { "send": [{ "bits": "1010" }] }, "b": { "send": [{ "bits": "1010" }] } },
          "expect": { "x": [1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0] }
        },
        {
          "wires": { "a": { "send": [{ "bits": "0000" }] }, "b": { "send": [{ "bits": "1111" }] } },
          "expect": { "x": [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] }
        }
      ],
      "want": { "x": "given" },
      "solution": ["z = const[value=0]()", "d = select(a, b, z)", "x <- d"],
      "naive": ["o = const[value=1]()", "d = select(a, o, b)", "x <- d"]
    }
  ]
}
